### fragment_ai.xml
- Header: was 2 rows (title + subtitle row). Now **single 48dp RelativeLayout row**: `ic_launcher` logo (26dp) + "Richie" bold + model pill + plan label on left; usage count + history button on right. Saves 40dp vertical space.
